WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.900
An emotional,

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.635
illuminating and at times,

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:03.970
frankly, infuriating

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.238
hearing on Capitol Hill today,

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:06.606
focusing on the chaotic US

00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:09.209
withdrawal from Afghanistan in 2021.

00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:11.144
CNN's Kiley Atwood reports for us now.

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:11.444
A U.S.

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:11.745
Marine

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:13.513
who was wounded in that horrific

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:14.714
suicide bomb attack

00:00:14.714 --> 00:00:16.216
outside the Kabul airport

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:18.184
testified that his unit spotted

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:20.520
an Afghan man that they believe

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.821
was the suicide bomber

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:22.856
spotted him ahead of time,

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:23.390
but they could not

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.558
get the authority to engage.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.395
My body was overwhelmed

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:30.063
from the trauma of the blast.

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:31.765
My abdomen had been ripped open

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:33.400
every inch of my exposed body

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.602
except for my face to ball bearings

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:36.803
and shrapnel.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:37.837
U.S.

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:38.371
Marine Corps

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:39.806
Sergeant Tyler Vargas

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:41.975
Andrews is now a double amputee.

00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:43.943
He was one of the 35 service

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:44.911
members injured

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:46.913
when a suicide bomber attacked Kabul

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:48.782
as the United States was withdrawing

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:49.949
from the country.

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:52.352
13 service members died that day.

00:00:52.619 --> 00:00:54.354
There was an inexcusable lack

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:56.156
of accountability and negligence.

00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:57.957
The 11 Marines, one sailor

00:00:59.426 --> 00:00:59.826
and one

00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:01.728
soldier that were murdered

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.930
that day have not been answered for.

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:05.732
The 25 year old shared his story

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:06.166
with the House

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:07.200
Foreign Affairs Committee

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.102
as they investigate the chaotic

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:10.136
and bloody U.S.

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:12.405
withdrawal from Afghanistan.

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:14.107
Hours before the attack, Vargas

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:16.076
Andrews used his sniper gun

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:18.111
to spot a man in the crowd of thousands

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:19.112
who looks like

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:20.080
the suicide bomber

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:21.281
that intelligence officials

00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:23.049
had warned was in the vicinity.

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:25.018
He showed the man to his team leader.

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:26.286
We asked him if we could shoot.

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:27.153
Our battalion commander

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:28.221
said, and I quote,

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:30.390
I don't know and quote myself

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:30.824
and my team.

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:31.891
We were asked very harshly.

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:32.992
Well, who does?

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:35.361
Because this is your responsibility, sir.

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:36.196
He again replied

00:01:36.196 --> 00:01:38.198
He did not know but would find out.

00:01:38.198 --> 00:01:40.400
Vargas Andrews never got an answer.

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:42.302
He told lawmakers that the Navy

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:43.236
and the FBI

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:44.437
failed to interview him

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:45.839
about his experience.

00:01:45.839 --> 00:01:47.273
Plain and simple, we were ignored.

00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:50.477
Our expertize was disregarded.

00:01:50.477 --> 00:01:51.478
No one was held accountable

00:01:51.478 --> 00:01:52.645
for our safety.

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:53.680
He's not the only U.S.

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:54.414
service member

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:55.081
who is haunted

00:01:55.081 --> 00:01:56.749
by the memories of that day.

00:01:56.749 --> 00:01:58.885
Here is former combat medic Aiden

00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:01.254
Gunderson screams from little children,

00:02:01.721 --> 00:02:02.589
women and groom

00:02:02.589 --> 00:02:04.190
and echoed in the tight corridor.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:05.425
Marines and corpsman around me

00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:06.559
through tears to provide

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:08.294
lifesaving aid to our motionless

00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:09.662
and severely injured

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:11.064
American brothers and sisters.

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:11.764
Over the next hour,

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:12.765
I tried to save the lives

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:13.700
of countless Marines.

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:15.301
We all try our best.

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:16.469
It was a nightmare.

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:17.303
Some witnesses

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:18.738
blamed the Biden ministration

00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:20.540
for the evacuations failures.

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:21.541
Good afternoon.

00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:23.543
Others widen the aperture.

00:02:23.543 --> 00:02:24.944
This is not the story of a Biden failure

00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:26.012
or a Trump failure.

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:27.480
This is a story of an American failure

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.515
and the effect it has had

00:02:28.515 --> 00:02:29.115
and continues

00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:30.350
to have on Afghans

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:31.518
who served alongside myself

00:02:31.518 --> 00:02:32.719
and so many others.

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:34.354
Multiple witnesses were U.S.

00:02:34.354 --> 00:02:36.689
veterans who set up unofficial networks

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:38.958
to help Afghans escape the country.

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:40.260
They said they got requests

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.394
from high ranking U.S.

00:02:41.394 --> 00:02:42.629
government officials

00:02:42.629 --> 00:02:44.597
to help them get people out.

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:45.732
Me. US.

00:02:45.732 --> 00:02:46.766
Private citizens

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:47.901
receiving requests

00:02:47.901 --> 00:02:49.469
from our own government

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:51.337
to assist what is essentially

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:52.739
a governmental function.

00:02:52.739 --> 00:02:53.740
It was humbling.

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:54.908
It was terrifying.

00:02:54.908 --> 00:02:57.343
It was at times stupefying.

00:02:59.012 --> 00:02:59.646
Now, one of

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:00.079
those who

00:03:00.079 --> 00:03:01.648
provided testimony today, Jake,

00:03:01.648 --> 00:03:03.850
warned of a mental health tsunami

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:05.885
for the veterans who were involved

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:07.687
in trying to get out Afghans

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:08.922
who they had actually worked

00:03:08.922 --> 00:03:09.989
with in Afghanistan

00:03:09.989 --> 00:03:10.823
and just talked

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:12.258
about how challenging that was

00:03:12.258 --> 00:03:13.826
and how hard it was on them

00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:15.161
when they weren't able to get out.

00:03:15.161 --> 00:03:16.329
Some of the folks that they worked

00:03:16.329 --> 00:03:17.463
with in the country

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:18.198
of course, today

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:19.799
we didn't see any Biden administration

00:03:19.799 --> 00:03:22.001
officials providing testimony.

00:03:22.001 --> 00:03:24.070
But we do expect that this committee

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:26.239
is going to be seeking out

00:03:26.239 --> 00:03:27.140
that testimony.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:28.141
From administration

00:03:28.141 --> 00:03:29.676
officials down the road.

00:03:29.676 --> 00:03:31.277
This is just an investigation

00:03:31.277 --> 00:03:32.612
that is only beginning.

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:34.414
And presumably this testimony

00:03:34.414 --> 00:03:35.915
that was provided today

00:03:35.915 --> 00:03:38.418
in in addition to documents that the

00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:40.486
they are trying to get from

00:03:40.486 --> 00:03:42.188
the administration are going to be

00:03:42.188 --> 00:03:43.323
what will drive

00:03:43.323 --> 00:03:44.090
the questions

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:45.892
for Biden administration officials

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:47.894
when they do provide testimony Jake.

00:03:47.994 --> 00:03:49.295
All right, Kelly, I would thank so much.

